\(\\mathrm{IsHeytingAlgebra}(\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X))\\)</span> (subobject Heyting algebra, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5aa17e379c0e3bc4\" href=\"?note=5aa17e379c0e3bc4\" title=\"14-thm-subobject-heyting-algebra\">14-thm-subobject-heyting-algebra</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)\\)</span> (subobject, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d3923e299ec2ec5a\" href=\"?note=d3923e299ec2ec5a\" title=\"14-df-subobjects\">14-df-subobjects</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Neg}_X\">\\(\\mathrm{Neg}_X\\)</span> (negation operation defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 为初等拓扑斯，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\">\\(X\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\)</span>；固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"1289398555ba3eed\" href=\"?note=1289398555ba3eed\" title=\"14-df-subobject-lattice-operations\">14-df-subobject-lattice-operations</a> 的全结构及其运算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Neg}_X(A)\\coloneqq A\\Rightarrow\\bot_X\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Neg}_X(A)\\coloneqq A\\Rightarrow\\bot_X\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书定位：I.8；IV.8。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\Rightarrow\\bot\">\\(A\\Rightarrow\\bot\\)</span> 是与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的交为零的最大子对象；这是伪补而非一般布尔补。底元和蕴涵已由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"1289398555ba3eed\" href=\"?note=1289398555ba3eed\" title=\"14-df-subobject-lattice-operations\">14-df-subobject-lattice-operations</a> 构造。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{