ng":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$A\\Rightarrow\\bot$ 是与 $A$ 的交为零的最大子对象；这是伪补而非一般布尔补。底元和蕴涵已由 [[14-df-subobject-lattice-operations]] 构造。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsHeytingAlgebra}(\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X))","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Neg}_X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Neg}_X(A)\\coloneqq A\\Rightarrow\\bot_X","display":true},{"tex":"A\\Rightarrow\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false}],"bytes":1186,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-126","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-heyting-negation|Definition — Heyting Negation]]"},{"id":"78d84752064c9948","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为 [[14-df-category]] 的候选范畴；$\\mathrm{IsElementaryTopos}$ 见 [[14-df-elementary-topos]]。当 $\\mathcal E$ 为初等拓扑斯时，对每个 $X\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)$，采用 [[14-df-heyting-negation]] 及其依赖中明确给出的子对象 Heyting 结构与 $\\mathrm{Neg}_X$；$\\vee$ 表示该结构的 $\\vee_X$。$\\mathrm{IsBoolean}$ 是以下定义的谓词。"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-40","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-heyting-negation]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-40","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-heyting-negation]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-127","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-heyting-negation|Definition — Heyting Negation]]"},{"id":"1d4177d202e67eb5","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为初等拓扑斯，$\\operatorname{IAC}$ 与 $\\operatorname{AC}$ 见 [[14-df-choice-axioms]]；布尔性见 [[14-df-boolean-topos]]，$\\mathrm{Neg}_X$ 是 [[14-df-heyting-negation]] 的子对象伪补。"},{"id":"ddd71b28b9e13b9b","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为初等拓扑斯，指定分类子 $(\\Omega,t:1\\to\\Omega)$。$\\mathsf T=[t]\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(\\Omega)$，$\\chi_{\\Omega}$ 是 [[14-thm-power-object-classification]] 的分类对应。$\\neg:\\Omega\\to\\Omega$ 与 $j$ 由下式构造。对 $S\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(A)$，$\\neg S$ 简写 [[14-df-heyting-negation]] 的 $\\mathrm{Neg}_A(S)$，不同于 $\\Omega$ 箭头本身。$\\mathbf{Sh}_j(\\mathcal E)$ 为 $j$ 层满子范畴。"},{"id":"a62d3691c564e069","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为 [[14-df-category]] 的范畴；$\\mathrm{IsElementaryTopos}$ 见 [[14-df-elementary-topos]]。在其成立的分支，对每个 $X\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal E)$，采用 [[14-thm-subobject-heyting-algebra]] 的 $\\mathbb{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)$；$\\wedge,\\leq$ 分别缩写该结构的 $\\wedge_X,\\leq_X$，$\\mathrm{Neg}_X$ 见 [[14-df-heyting-negation]]。"}],"outgoing":["1289398555ba3eed","5aa17e379c0e3bc4","91189e210bff4156","d3923e299ec2ec5a"]}